</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Oh, praise the Lord, man died in God</l><l>And to an end was brought!</l><l>Now from this man I’m wholly free</l><l>For God has terminated me!</l><l>Oh, what a wondrous death,</l><l>Oh, what a wondrous death;</l><l>Oh, hallelujah, for such a death!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Oh, praise the Lord, God died in man,</l><l>In man to be released.</l><l>The grain of wheat fell to the ground,</l><l>And now a multitude is found</l><l>Filled with the life of God,</l><l>Filled with the life of God;</l><l>Oh, hallelujah, for such a life!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, how we praise You for Your cross,</l><l>Your all-inclusive death!</l><l>The center of the universe,</l><l>It has untold, eternal worth!</l><l>Lord, how we love Your cross,</l><l>Lord, how we love Your cross;</l><l>Oh, hallelujah, for such a cross!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
